<!--
    The status bar icon.

    Notification icons are drawn as a silhouette: the system takes the alpha channel only, so the
    shape has to be readable in one colour at a small size. A filled tag with a hole punched for
    the hole reads better than an outline at 24dp, and a "percent" shape would be unreadable.

    The artwork is deliberately plain, because anything decorative here turns into a blob.
-->
